# Milestone: M3
# Covers: System.cycle monotonically increases across sequential statements (';');
#         '|' separator executes within the same cycle; compound expressions.
# blocked: System.cycle counter not implemented
# matrix-row: stdlib-system
#
# Reason:
#   The fixture uses 'System.cycle' — a scheduler cycle counter exposed via
#   'import System.*'.  The System namespace and cycle counter are M4 stdlib
#   features (part of the stats/introspection surface).  At M3 there is no
#   System namespace available in urbiscript.  The underlying determinism counter
#   (urbi_get_determinism_checksum) is a C API diagnostic, not exposed to the
#   script layer at M3.
#
# Original urbiscript (activate at M4 with System stdlib):
# # import System.*|;
# # { var ref = cycle | { {} | {} } | cycle - ref };
# # [00000001] 0
# # { var ref = cycle; {}; {}; cycle - ref };
# # [00000003] 3
